      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，我会将胜利──\n为了引导所有的赛马娘获得幸福，\n我将会献上一切。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45ff558c9108899fb2c3995fa74c25d987134c3c0728c6fe0ac8ea9385dcdc41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
