      "uid": "zhcn:d50331251457b2a52c64871e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征的“日本杯”参赛宣言，\n让世间陷入了前所未有的狂热。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63353cb4d2809b31ca0c5a3202724a30c3f9ea347f1050fb9dd37c3675c5df4d",
